WEBVTT

01:31.800 --> 01:33.800
ADAPTED FROM THE BLOSSOMING LOVE
BY SUI YU ER AN ON ICEREAD.COM

01:45.280 --> 01:46.360
Don't catch a cold.

01:49.160 --> 01:52.080
I suddenly remembered the first time
you took me to the Snow City.

01:53.600 --> 01:55.600
Back then, when you brought me back,

01:55.680 --> 01:57.280
it was to keep an eye on me, wasn't it?

01:58.320 --> 02:00.280
What if the Immortal Alliance finds out?

02:00.360 --> 02:01.240
Find out what?

02:03.240 --> 02:04.640
That the Alliance Leader

02:04.720 --> 02:06.840
fell in love with the cunning Saintess
of the Dark Abyss?

02:06.920 --> 02:08.680
That would be big news.

02:08.759 --> 02:10.440
Or are you planning

02:10.520 --> 02:13.040
to tell them directly
I am the Chaos Pearl?

02:15.320 --> 02:17.840
It's better to keep your identity
as the Chaos Pearl a secret.

02:17.920 --> 02:19.680
Otherwise, you will be the target

02:19.760 --> 02:21.160
of a multitude of arrows.

02:21.240 --> 02:25.200
Then how do you plan
to introduce me to the Snow City?

02:28.080 --> 02:28.920
As expected,

02:29.000 --> 02:31.760
our relationship would still trouble him

02:31.840 --> 02:33.920
if the Immortal Alliance knew about it.

02:35.600 --> 02:39.480
Actually, keeping it from them
and sneaking around is quite fun.

02:40.000 --> 02:42.640
That constant feeling
of possibly being found out

02:42.720 --> 02:44.160
is more thrilling

02:44.240 --> 02:45.120
than making it public.

02:49.320 --> 02:51.400
I really wonder what goes on

02:51.480 --> 02:52.920
in your little head every day.

02:53.440 --> 02:54.720
I'm thinking…

03:18.200 --> 03:20.040
If seeing them together
makes you uncomfortable,

03:20.640 --> 03:22.360
why follow them here?

03:22.880 --> 03:24.680
Out of sight, out of mind.

03:25.280 --> 03:26.120
Wouldn't that be better?

03:27.040 --> 03:28.600
How did you know I'm uncomfortable?

03:30.120 --> 03:31.240
The ending is set.

03:31.320 --> 03:33.040
Fate cannot be changed.

03:34.640 --> 03:36.640
Qian Guang
or Feng Xiang couldn't alter it,

03:39.960 --> 03:41.280
nor could they.

03:56.600 --> 03:57.440
-Lord of the City…
-Sir.

03:57.520 --> 03:58.760
-Sir!
-Sir!

03:58.840 --> 03:59.840
Mr. Nan.

04:09.440 --> 04:11.600
Mu Xuanling! What are you doing here?

04:14.720 --> 04:15.640
I…

04:17.680 --> 04:18.800
He…

04:18.880 --> 04:21.160
He dragged me back to repent for my sins.

04:21.240 --> 04:22.280
Repent for your sins?

04:29.960 --> 04:31.680
She wasn't dragged back.

04:33.160 --> 04:34.000
I asked her

04:34.760 --> 04:35.600
to come home with me.

04:39.160 --> 04:40.280
Sir,

04:40.800 --> 04:42.680
-did you two really…
-It's a long story.

04:43.360 --> 04:44.960
The wind and snow are harsh
in the Snow City.

04:45.040 --> 04:46.720
Let's not talk here.

04:48.680 --> 04:49.520
Let's go.

04:53.040 --> 04:53.920
Hey…

04:59.280 --> 05:00.960
Sleeping on a real bed
after that boat cabin,

05:01.040 --> 05:02.560
it's so much more comfortable.

05:14.800 --> 05:17.080
He has kept it for me for all this time?

05:18.080 --> 05:21.000
Has Xie Xuechen peeked at it?

05:29.920 --> 05:31.200
Why are you here?

05:31.280 --> 05:32.320
Come sit.

05:34.080 --> 05:35.880
All the sects heard that
Xuechen was coming back,

05:35.960 --> 05:37.560
so they sent people to wait for him.

05:37.640 --> 05:39.920
Xuechen has to report
the Pearl searching results to them.

05:40.760 --> 05:43.120
What do you think? Want to go listen?

05:43.920 --> 05:45.640
The searching results?

05:49.320 --> 05:50.360
No, thanks.

05:50.440 --> 05:52.600
I can't stand Elder Cang's
heartbroken look.

05:54.240 --> 05:55.880
I won't go and provoke him.

05:55.960 --> 05:57.000
All right.

05:57.840 --> 05:59.400
Then I'll stay here with you,

06:00.360 --> 06:03.120
just like before, two outsiders

06:03.680 --> 06:04.520
supporting each other.

06:05.200 --> 06:08.800
I can give you what you want, including…

06:10.160 --> 06:11.320
that little affection.

06:12.080 --> 06:13.120
Perhaps

06:13.200 --> 06:15.400
we could become friends even closer.

06:17.640 --> 06:18.760
Nan Xuyue,

06:19.360 --> 06:20.200
back then, I said that

06:20.280 --> 06:21.480
-because of the Disillusion Water--
-I know.

06:23.400 --> 06:24.600
Just joking.

06:26.280 --> 06:27.680
You don't mind?

06:32.120 --> 06:33.520
Mind what?

06:34.920 --> 06:37.160
Mind you being together with him?

06:41.280 --> 06:43.080
If I said I didn't mind at all,

06:44.040 --> 06:45.240
I'd be lying to you.

06:47.160 --> 06:48.600
Since you already know,

06:49.280 --> 06:51.920
why are you still willing
to come back to the Snow City with us?

06:53.920 --> 06:55.880
Although your choice
makes me feel a bit uneasy,

06:58.560 --> 06:59.720
as long as you're happy,

07:00.520 --> 07:01.680
that's enough.

07:16.000 --> 07:17.600
Don't you want to go listen?

07:19.360 --> 07:20.400
No.

07:22.960 --> 07:24.440
Since you don't want to go,

07:25.560 --> 07:27.120
then I won't join the crowd either.

07:29.040 --> 07:29.960
Get some rest.

07:31.080 --> 07:33.160
-I'll take my leave now.
-Wait.

07:41.440 --> 07:42.960
I've been wanting

07:43.520 --> 07:45.320
to return this jade to you.

07:52.400 --> 07:53.640
Why?

07:57.520 --> 07:58.960
My heart belongs to Xie Xuechen,

07:59.800 --> 08:01.440
and there will never be anyone else
in my heart.

08:02.280 --> 08:05.480
So, I can't keep accepting your kindness.

08:06.000 --> 08:07.640
I don't want to owe a debt I can't repay.

08:15.040 --> 08:16.760
I never intended for you to return it.

08:18.080 --> 08:20.720
On the contrary, I hoped
you'd owe me this little favor.

08:22.440 --> 08:23.520
Someday,

08:24.280 --> 08:25.800
it might make you think of me as a friend.

08:34.840 --> 08:35.679
Fine.

08:37.360 --> 08:38.880
We're just ordinary friends.

08:41.120 --> 08:42.520
I shouldn't even touch you.

08:44.080 --> 08:45.320
Keep it.

08:46.640 --> 08:48.680
It's just a token of care
between ordinary friends.

08:50.760 --> 08:52.400
One last question!

08:54.960 --> 08:56.720
What does Xie Xuechen

08:57.560 --> 08:58.800
mean to you?

09:03.160 --> 09:04.560
What do you think?

09:06.880 --> 09:08.040
Because of me,

09:08.680 --> 09:11.040
you lied to him and kept things from him.

09:12.280 --> 09:14.680
That doesn't seem like something
a friend would do.

09:16.760 --> 09:17.920
Or perhaps,

09:18.680 --> 09:19.880
all along,

09:20.600 --> 09:22.760
you've just been pretending
to be his friend?

09:24.240 --> 09:25.240
Nan Xuyue,

09:26.560 --> 09:28.760
how much of your care for him is sincere?

09:38.880 --> 09:40.640
If I weren't sincere,

09:41.160 --> 09:42.760
then back at the Greenview Heights,

09:42.840 --> 09:46.200
in the Snow City or the Mirage Palace,
I could've just stood by

09:46.280 --> 09:47.960
and let him die.

09:48.640 --> 09:50.560
Why would I have saved him?

09:52.960 --> 09:54.040
Mu Xuanling,

09:55.320 --> 09:57.560
you've seen all this for yourself.

10:01.880 --> 10:03.320
After ten years in the Dark Abyss,

10:04.280 --> 10:05.840
I've grown used to not trusting anyone.

10:07.800 --> 10:08.800
Nan Xuyue,

10:10.480 --> 10:12.440
I want to see you as an old friend,

10:13.880 --> 10:15.840
but your actions make me doubt.

10:23.360 --> 10:25.320
Xie Xuechen is my bottom line.

10:27.200 --> 10:28.560
If we're to move forward,

10:29.320 --> 10:31.680
you don't act, and I won't act.

10:33.240 --> 10:34.640
But if one day

10:34.720 --> 10:36.760
you hurt Xie Xuechen,

10:38.600 --> 10:40.560
I will show no mercy.

10:58.560 --> 10:59.520
Fine.

11:02.280 --> 11:03.560
If that day comes

11:04.920 --> 11:06.360
and I hurt him,

11:08.360 --> 11:10.400
you can take my life.

11:32.760 --> 11:33.960
Having sincerity

11:34.760 --> 11:36.160
and being sincere

11:37.200 --> 11:38.760
are not the same.

11:58.440 --> 11:59.360
Sir,

12:00.840 --> 12:03.080
do you think she fully trusts you?

12:07.840 --> 12:09.040
As she said,

12:09.880 --> 12:11.200
these ten years in the Dark Abyss

12:12.040 --> 12:13.760
have made her stop trusting others easily.

12:15.800 --> 12:17.400
But because of those experiences,

12:18.240 --> 12:20.240
she understands better than anyone

12:21.560 --> 12:22.960
that making another enemy

12:23.480 --> 12:24.960
isn't good for anyone.

12:25.680 --> 12:27.440
It's better to maintain the current state…

12:31.520 --> 12:33.240
even if this current state

12:36.720 --> 12:38.480
is already on the point of collapse.

12:47.560 --> 12:50.160
Is the Chaos Pearl
truly impossible to find?

12:51.160 --> 12:52.480
Regarding the Chaos Pearl,

12:53.000 --> 12:54.600
since I've already agreed,
I will see it through to the end.

12:55.280 --> 12:56.200
Please rest assured, Elder.

12:57.480 --> 12:58.360
Very well.

13:03.360 --> 13:04.600
And what about Mu Xuanling?

13:08.320 --> 13:09.240
Xuechen,

13:10.320 --> 13:11.440
I've watched you grow up.

13:12.160 --> 13:13.160
I've also seen you

13:13.680 --> 13:15.040
transform from a reckless youth

13:15.120 --> 13:16.800
into the composed
and steady man you are today.

13:17.920 --> 13:21.200
I've seen you pay the price
for your past mistakes,

13:21.280 --> 13:23.520
imprisoning yourself for seven years
at the Snow Cliff.

13:24.240 --> 13:25.400
Honestly,

13:25.920 --> 13:27.040
I've always hoped

13:27.120 --> 13:30.200
you'd find a lifelong partner
to stay by your side,

13:32.920 --> 13:35.080
so you wouldn't walk this path alone.

13:37.360 --> 13:39.520
But the less likely someone
is to fall in love,

13:40.120 --> 13:42.720
the deeper they'll fall when they do,

13:42.800 --> 13:44.080
lost with no escape.

13:45.440 --> 13:46.560
In the end,

13:46.640 --> 13:48.960
their obsessions
will turn into inner demons,

13:50.040 --> 13:52.200
shaking their faith again.

13:53.720 --> 13:55.760
But I no longer want to avoid my feelings.

13:57.160 --> 13:58.840
Because I've come to understand my heart.

14:00.360 --> 14:02.280
The desire to protect someone

14:03.040 --> 14:04.600
can make my faith stronger

14:04.680 --> 14:05.960
and more steadfast.

14:06.840 --> 14:07.920
Rest assured,

14:08.440 --> 14:09.680
I won't repeat the mistakes of the past.

14:09.760 --> 14:11.200
Even so,

14:11.920 --> 14:13.920
that partner should be upright and kind,

14:14.000 --> 14:16.800
not someone like Mu Xuanling,
cunning and unpredictable.

14:17.320 --> 14:20.240
How can I rest easy
or face your father like this?

14:20.320 --> 14:22.200
She has left the Dark Abyss

14:22.720 --> 14:24.400
and will no longer threaten
the Immortal Alliance.

14:25.400 --> 14:26.560
Silly child.

14:27.680 --> 14:30.360
I'm not worried about her endangering
the Immortal Alliance.

14:30.440 --> 14:32.040
I'm worried she'll hurt you.

14:34.440 --> 14:36.280
I hope you truly understand

14:36.360 --> 14:38.120
what kind of person you've fallen for

14:38.200 --> 14:40.920
and that you're not just blinded
by her tricks.

14:41.440 --> 14:44.080
Or in the end,
you might find yourself hurt

14:44.680 --> 14:45.520
and disappointed.

14:50.840 --> 14:52.040
Elder Cang,

14:52.640 --> 14:54.600
I know the things you've said today

14:54.680 --> 14:55.840
are for my sake.

14:56.600 --> 14:57.920
But I believe

14:58.960 --> 15:01.680
I've never been more certain
of what I'm doing than I am now.

15:02.440 --> 15:04.120
I trust in her feelings for me,

15:04.960 --> 15:06.240
and I trust my judgment of her.

15:15.640 --> 15:17.360
It seems I've been overly concerned.

15:19.000 --> 15:20.000
Let's hope

15:20.600 --> 15:23.400
Mu Xuanling doesn't betray your sincerity.

15:26.320 --> 15:29.560
Looks like attending this meeting
was worth it after all.

15:31.400 --> 15:33.160
SWIRLING SNOW PAVILION

15:33.240 --> 15:34.080
Mu Xuanling.

15:42.160 --> 15:43.400
What are you doing?

15:53.000 --> 15:54.640
That day in the Snow City,

15:54.720 --> 15:56.720
when I fell
under the Xuantian Sect's Curse,

15:57.240 --> 15:58.600
I woke up right here.

15:59.600 --> 16:02.880
Back then,
I thought your room was too empty.

16:02.960 --> 16:04.920
So, I created many flowers

16:05.000 --> 16:06.520
to give you a surprise.

16:08.760 --> 16:11.400
Later, Sang Qi
dragged me into an illusion,

16:12.400 --> 16:14.480
and I learned my days were numbered.

16:14.560 --> 16:15.880
I was even forced to try and kill you.

16:16.640 --> 16:18.040
In my anger,

16:18.560 --> 16:21.160
I made all the flowers
in this room disappear.

16:23.400 --> 16:24.840
But now we're all back.

16:25.720 --> 16:28.560
I thought
you should see them at least once.

16:33.040 --> 16:34.320
I remember that day…

16:35.440 --> 16:37.320
I brought you so many pastries,

16:37.840 --> 16:39.280
only to find you were already gone.

16:40.520 --> 16:42.800
I always thought you were mad at me
for coming back too late.

16:43.840 --> 16:45.240
I never realized

16:46.080 --> 16:47.480
you endured so much back then.

16:52.440 --> 16:53.600
It won't happen again.

16:59.240 --> 17:02.720
Actually, I'm not saying this
to make you feel sorry for me.

17:02.800 --> 17:04.160
I just want to tell you

17:04.240 --> 17:06.000
that as long as I'm here,

17:06.079 --> 17:08.640
I won't let your days be so lonely again.

17:09.319 --> 17:10.920
But you'd better be prepared

17:11.520 --> 17:13.680
because this room might

17:13.760 --> 17:16.200
start filling up
with all sorts of unexpected things.

17:18.440 --> 17:20.079
From now on, everything in this room

17:20.720 --> 17:21.640
is up to you to manage.

17:21.720 --> 17:22.880
Oh?

17:24.800 --> 17:25.800
Well then…

17:26.319 --> 17:27.720
what about you in this room?

17:29.600 --> 17:30.600
I'm yours as well.

17:36.240 --> 17:38.360
You're surprisingly agreeable now.

17:38.880 --> 17:40.200
Back then,

17:40.720 --> 17:41.680
if I touched you,

17:42.680 --> 17:44.160
you'd shout and threaten to kill me.

17:44.920 --> 17:46.480
You even said,

17:47.200 --> 17:48.920
"Those close to demons grow bad."

17:52.480 --> 17:53.960
It's different now.

17:54.760 --> 17:57.360
Now it's,
"Those close to the Pearl grow bright."

17:58.760 --> 18:00.560
So, does this Pearl of mine

18:00.640 --> 18:02.320
still need to keep learning
from Elder Cang?

18:02.400 --> 18:04.200
If you're really worried,

18:05.400 --> 18:07.160
-I can teach you myself.
-No, thanks.

18:08.480 --> 18:09.360
You see, I'm the kind of person

18:09.440 --> 18:12.280
who likes doing what I'm not supposed to.

18:12.360 --> 18:13.760
The more that old man dislikes me,

18:13.840 --> 18:16.080
the more I want him to like me.

18:18.520 --> 18:19.360
True enough.

18:20.320 --> 18:21.720
You've always had a knack

18:22.280 --> 18:23.520
for insisting on your way.

18:26.280 --> 18:29.120
That brings more fun.

18:39.080 --> 18:40.080
Twisted logic.

18:43.600 --> 18:44.760
You don't believe me?

18:46.000 --> 18:48.960
Tonight, let me test it on you

18:49.040 --> 18:50.560
and see if it brings more fun.

18:57.440 --> 18:59.200
-I'm very busy tonight.
-Busy with what?

18:59.280 --> 19:00.320
Official duties.

19:03.600 --> 19:05.560
So, you're spending

19:06.080 --> 19:07.680
such a wonderful evening
on official duties?

19:13.440 --> 19:14.560
Perhaps

19:15.680 --> 19:16.960
you should head back to sleep now.

19:20.840 --> 19:21.840
Or you can…

19:22.560 --> 19:23.880
sleep here.

19:24.640 --> 19:25.600
Great!

19:28.960 --> 19:30.160
Then I'll wait here for you to return.

19:47.320 --> 19:48.160
Xie Xuechen,

19:49.400 --> 19:51.040
your bed is too big.

19:51.120 --> 19:53.760
Sleeping alone makes me feel so scared.

20:05.920 --> 20:06.960
Xie Xuechen,

20:07.480 --> 20:10.000
I never thought
I'd be doing something this boring

20:10.080 --> 20:11.920
with someone one day.

20:14.280 --> 20:15.120
Boring?

20:16.800 --> 20:18.400
Then, why are you so happy?

20:20.800 --> 20:21.760
Yeah, why?

20:22.360 --> 20:23.640
I don't know either.

20:24.360 --> 20:27.160
Doing something so boring
and yet feeling so happy.

20:34.360 --> 20:35.920
What exactly is love?

20:37.440 --> 20:39.480
Love… Is it desire,

20:40.640 --> 20:41.840
or is it motivation?

20:43.440 --> 20:44.800
As long as the sun rises and sets

20:45.440 --> 20:46.760
and the universe endures,

20:47.560 --> 20:48.960
we'll always be together.

21:04.520 --> 21:06.360
It's been years
since I've seen you angry, Sir.

21:08.280 --> 21:09.640
I dreamed of her again.

21:12.200 --> 21:13.840
I could see her clearly,

21:15.640 --> 21:17.320
but I couldn't tell where it was.

21:19.000 --> 21:21.720
You've been searching for that place
from your dreams for many years now.

21:22.280 --> 21:23.680
Will you keep looking?

21:26.680 --> 21:28.960
The feeling of losing control

21:30.880 --> 21:32.280
is truly unpleasant.

21:43.120 --> 21:44.200
Feng Yao,

21:45.120 --> 21:46.440
stay here and keep watching.

21:47.920 --> 21:49.480
Don't let anyone know I've left.

21:50.400 --> 21:51.440
Understood.

22:14.440 --> 22:17.040
Tonight, I don't want to kill.
If you don't want to die,

22:17.560 --> 22:18.400
retreat.

22:19.320 --> 22:20.600
Mr. Nan.

22:23.160 --> 22:24.720
Judging by your tone,

22:24.800 --> 22:26.800
it seems you're not in a good mood today.

22:27.560 --> 22:28.760
As it happens,

22:28.840 --> 22:30.720
I've just received some fresh tea.

22:31.240 --> 22:33.480
Mr. Nan, would you like
to try some with me?

22:40.400 --> 22:42.000
The message you sent through my people

22:42.520 --> 22:43.760
has already reached me.

22:45.400 --> 22:48.160
Rest assured. I won't touch Mu Xuanling.

22:48.240 --> 22:51.520
That's not why I'm here this time.

22:53.920 --> 22:55.800
Now I'm curious.

22:55.880 --> 22:58.480
Aside from Mu Xuanling and Xie Xuechen,

22:58.560 --> 23:00.400
what else in this world

23:00.480 --> 23:01.880
could matter so much to you?

23:09.480 --> 23:11.520
You've been drinking tea

23:11.600 --> 23:13.280
from the mortal world for so many years.

23:14.840 --> 23:16.240
Aren't you tired of it?

23:19.560 --> 23:20.920
The mortal world…

23:23.240 --> 23:24.880
Mr. Nan, the way you phrased that

23:25.400 --> 23:27.000
seems rather meaningful.

23:27.640 --> 23:29.480
I know what you want.

23:30.320 --> 23:31.520
I can help you.

23:32.560 --> 23:33.600
For example,

23:35.320 --> 23:36.480
opening the Celestial Ladder.

23:39.960 --> 23:41.240
You have your warriors,

23:41.320 --> 23:42.640
and I have my spies.

23:42.720 --> 23:44.840
Over the years,
aside from the Chaos Pearl,

23:44.920 --> 23:46.200
you've also been searching for the site

23:46.280 --> 23:47.600
where the Celestial Ladder
fell 10,000 years ago,

23:47.680 --> 23:49.480
and the method
to restore the divine artifact.

23:49.560 --> 23:52.200
Isn't it to reopen the Celestial Ladder

23:52.280 --> 23:53.680
using the Chaos Pearl?

23:58.400 --> 24:00.520
Having known you for so many years,

24:01.040 --> 24:02.240
there are some things

24:02.760 --> 24:03.920
I've kept unsaid,

24:04.680 --> 24:06.040
but that doesn't mean I don't know.

24:09.880 --> 24:12.000
Though you have lost three
of your spiritual channels,

24:13.120 --> 24:14.800
you are clearer than anyone else

24:17.760 --> 24:19.160
in this world.

24:24.160 --> 24:26.720
I don't doubt your capabilities.

24:26.800 --> 24:28.720
But since we're talking about cooperation,

24:29.800 --> 24:31.280
I have to know

24:31.360 --> 24:33.400
what is it that you want.

24:38.400 --> 24:41.680
A place I've searched
all through the Dark Abyss

24:42.600 --> 24:45.200
and the human realm but never found.

24:45.800 --> 24:47.120
I was thinking…

24:49.240 --> 24:50.760
maybe it's in the Celestial Realm.

24:55.680 --> 24:57.520
Dragging us out here
in the middle of the night…

24:57.600 --> 24:59.560
What's this about?

24:59.640 --> 25:00.960
Haven't you noticed

25:01.760 --> 25:03.960
that ever since Sang Qi began cultivating
the Jade Vault Technique,

25:04.040 --> 25:06.480
the Dark Abyss's demonic energy
has surged?

25:07.000 --> 25:08.400
Even this Lava

25:08.480 --> 25:10.000
isn't what it used to be.

25:10.680 --> 25:11.520
Are you implying

25:13.960 --> 25:15.520
the one below?

25:17.040 --> 25:18.040
Could it be

25:18.120 --> 25:20.320
that the Fallen Deity is waking up?

25:21.000 --> 25:22.240
What if…

25:23.200 --> 25:24.640
he's already awake?

25:48.200 --> 25:49.840
Xie Xuechen.

25:56.120 --> 25:57.600
Xie Xuechen.

26:04.000 --> 26:05.960
Xie Xuechen.

26:08.200 --> 26:10.200
Xie Xuechen.

26:21.800 --> 26:23.720
Xie Xuechen! Xie Xuechen!

26:25.640 --> 26:26.960
Xie Xuechen.

26:28.200 --> 26:30.200
We'll be meeting very soon.

26:35.080 --> 26:36.440
Sir.

26:36.520 --> 26:38.160
Did your discussion go well?

26:39.320 --> 26:41.200
If the plan succeeds, it will go well.

26:42.040 --> 26:42.880
And what if it fails?

26:46.360 --> 26:47.960
Then we'll stand against the entire world.

26:53.080 --> 26:54.200
Mr. Yan.

26:54.280 --> 26:56.480
I'm here to inform Mr. Nan…
Mr. Xie is in trouble!

27:01.440 --> 27:02.560
It's not an injury,

27:03.560 --> 27:04.880
nor an illness.

27:04.960 --> 27:08.280
From his pulse,
there's nothing wrong at all.

27:13.120 --> 27:14.320
Having nothing wrong

27:14.400 --> 27:16.160
is the biggest problem of all.

27:17.880 --> 27:19.480
Xie Xuechen, you're awake.

27:22.920 --> 27:23.760
What happened to me?

27:24.880 --> 27:27.000
You were unconscious for two hours.

27:27.080 --> 27:27.920
Two hours?

27:29.640 --> 27:30.800
Just now…

27:31.760 --> 27:34.160
Just now, I think I heard
someone calling my name.

27:35.560 --> 27:36.480
Who was it?

27:37.120 --> 27:38.200
I don't know.

27:39.480 --> 27:40.720
This condition…

27:42.760 --> 27:44.960
sounds more like a soul intrusion.

27:47.280 --> 27:48.720
Soul intrusion?

27:50.200 --> 27:51.240
Do you remember

27:51.840 --> 27:53.080
I was once possessed by the Dark Clan?

27:56.760 --> 27:58.160
You're saying…

27:59.160 --> 28:01.280
a Dark Clan member
connected with you just now?

28:02.280 --> 28:03.440
I'm not sure.

28:04.720 --> 28:06.040
But for some reason,

28:07.240 --> 28:08.440
that voice felt…

28:09.680 --> 28:11.720
felt strangely familiar.

28:16.120 --> 28:17.440
Familiar?

28:20.560 --> 28:23.040
Xuechen, don't jump to conclusions

28:23.120 --> 28:24.760
based on a single calling.

28:28.080 --> 28:29.320
The birth and death of the Dark Clan

28:30.320 --> 28:31.720
cycle through the Void Sea.

28:31.800 --> 28:33.000
Perhaps the answer

28:34.120 --> 28:35.160
lies in the Dark Abyss.

28:36.680 --> 28:37.920
Could it be…

28:38.720 --> 28:39.560
Mister…

28:40.560 --> 28:41.640
He's back?

28:49.040 --> 28:53.280
DECAYING IMMORTAL PAVILION

29:00.920 --> 29:01.800
Sir,

29:02.560 --> 29:04.600
Spirit Clan warriors
have already gathered outside the sects.

29:04.680 --> 29:07.560
Once the Immortals Array is broken,
they can ally with the Dark Clan

29:07.640 --> 29:09.480
to destroy the Immortal Alliance
in one strike.

29:15.400 --> 29:16.800
Leave the rest

29:17.680 --> 29:19.080
to me.

29:24.560 --> 29:26.400
Go do your righteous deeds.

29:27.640 --> 29:28.560
The path you need

29:29.200 --> 29:30.480
is already paved for you.

29:33.600 --> 29:35.040
Thank you, sir.

29:43.440 --> 29:44.760
Are you still thinking about last night?

29:48.440 --> 29:51.280
Or… are you thinking about Mister?

29:54.000 --> 29:55.560
You're the one thinking about Mister,
aren't you?

29:56.160 --> 29:57.000
I thought about him,

29:58.000 --> 29:59.400
but I only thought of one thing.

30:00.520 --> 30:01.600
You are you,

30:02.400 --> 30:03.880
and Mister is Mister.

30:06.000 --> 30:07.240
Right now,

30:07.760 --> 30:09.400
the only person in my heart and mind

30:09.920 --> 30:11.040
is you.

30:17.040 --> 30:18.640
Sir, we've received a tip.

30:22.080 --> 30:23.240
You previously instructed me

30:23.320 --> 30:24.680
to have disciples secretly monitor
the various sects

30:24.760 --> 30:26.680
in case the Decaying Immortal Pavilion
made a move.

30:26.760 --> 30:29.320
We've discovered
that He Xianwo, Lord of the Osprey Island,

30:29.840 --> 30:31.160
is never on the island.

30:31.680 --> 30:34.240
In such troubled times, where could he be?

30:36.800 --> 30:38.280
-Xuechen! Xuechen!
-Xie Xuechen!

30:39.000 --> 30:40.160
-Xie Xuechen!
-Senior!

30:40.240 --> 30:41.040
Xuechen!

30:42.440 --> 30:43.760
Xie Xuechen!

30:47.560 --> 30:48.560
Xie Xuechen!

30:49.240 --> 30:51.000
-Xuechen!
-Xie Xuechen!

30:56.520 --> 30:58.000
Are you okay?

31:02.000 --> 31:03.000
Why…

31:04.320 --> 31:05.400
Why are you staring at me like that?

31:13.960 --> 31:15.080
Xuanling…

31:17.240 --> 31:18.080
Xuanling…

31:22.560 --> 31:23.520
Xuanling…

31:25.560 --> 31:27.600
I won't let you face any more danger.

31:29.360 --> 31:30.560
I can't bear to lose you again.

31:31.520 --> 31:34.000
Xie Xuechen, what's wrong with you?

31:38.960 --> 31:40.560
What exactly is going on?

31:44.800 --> 31:46.200
He Xianwo is the Master
of the Decaying Immortal Pavilion.

31:46.280 --> 31:48.000
He's heading to the Dark Abyss
to break the Immortals Array.

31:48.080 --> 31:50.120
What? How do you know?

31:50.720 --> 31:52.120
There's no time to explain.

31:52.760 --> 31:54.640
I need to teleport myself
there immediately.

31:54.720 --> 31:55.600
Where is Nan Xuyue?

32:13.080 --> 32:14.480
Should I call you Lord He
of the Osprey Island

32:15.680 --> 32:17.040
or the Master
of the Decaying Immortal Pavilion?

32:20.080 --> 32:23.440
If I recall correctly,
you've only seen my face once.

32:24.440 --> 32:25.880
What gave me away?

32:27.360 --> 32:30.040
Or… who told you?

32:32.040 --> 32:34.040
-Let me go!
-Senior said to wait for him to return!

32:36.080 --> 32:36.920
He's there now.

32:40.480 --> 32:42.800
He's alone on that side.
What if he faces danger?

32:42.880 --> 32:44.800
Xuechen is strong-willed.

32:44.880 --> 32:47.360
If you don't go, he'll have one less worry

32:47.440 --> 32:48.360
and face one less danger.

32:49.560 --> 32:51.160
So, how exactly

32:51.240 --> 32:52.480
did Xie Xuechen figure out

32:52.560 --> 32:54.680
that He Xianwo is the Master
of the Decaying Immortal Pavilion?

32:55.200 --> 32:58.600
And how did he know that He Xianwo
was heading to the Dark Abyss?

32:59.320 --> 33:00.320
Your aura is calm and steady,

33:01.400 --> 33:02.440
far from that of a youth.

33:03.040 --> 33:04.800
Though there are many cultivators
in the world,

33:04.880 --> 33:05.880
aside from disguise techniques,

33:06.480 --> 33:08.480
only you can use shapeshifting
and skin-changing.

33:08.560 --> 33:10.360
Who exactly are you?

33:10.440 --> 33:11.760
You didn't answer my questions,

33:12.360 --> 33:14.000
yet you want to learn from me?

33:14.600 --> 33:15.600
No matter.

33:16.480 --> 33:17.920
Whether you answer or not,

33:18.800 --> 33:20.120
I'm killing you today.

33:20.200 --> 33:21.160
Perfect.

33:21.840 --> 33:22.960
That suits me just fine.

33:32.160 --> 33:34.880
In such a short time,
your strength has surged.

33:34.960 --> 33:36.600
Quite impressive!

33:38.160 --> 33:39.600
What's going on?

33:39.680 --> 33:42.080
Xie Xuechen was strong,
but not this strong.

33:42.160 --> 33:45.520
Why does he now carry
such a desperate, all-or-nothing aura?

33:58.920 --> 34:00.600
Just give me a little more time…

34:00.680 --> 34:01.760
Just a little more.

34:02.280 --> 34:04.360
Why now of all times,

34:04.440 --> 34:06.320
when things could have been changed?

34:08.320 --> 34:09.840
You know him well.

34:09.920 --> 34:11.760
Don't you think
he's been acting strange just now?

34:11.840 --> 34:13.040
Why do you say that?

34:13.120 --> 34:14.239
Well…

34:15.199 --> 34:17.000
Did he ever behave like that before?

34:17.080 --> 34:19.040
Suddenly, he seems like
a completely different person,

34:19.560 --> 34:22.719
doing strange things,
and saying puzzling words.

34:25.199 --> 34:27.760
Senior occasionally
shows his true feelings.

34:29.080 --> 34:30.719
There's nothing strange about that.

34:31.480 --> 34:32.520
Really?

34:34.040 --> 34:35.719
My intuition is usually accurate.

34:36.239 --> 34:37.920
What exactly feels off?

34:39.320 --> 34:41.280
Xie Xuechen was acting strange today.

34:41.360 --> 34:43.199
He doesn't have future-seeing abilities,

34:43.280 --> 34:44.960
so, logically,

34:45.480 --> 34:46.840
he shouldn't have known
He Xianwo's whereabouts.

34:49.120 --> 34:50.320
Perhaps…

34:51.560 --> 34:53.280
it's related to the incident last night.

34:53.360 --> 34:54.600
But

34:54.679 --> 34:56.159
aren't you worried He Xianwo

34:56.239 --> 34:57.800
will tell Xie Xuechen about you?

34:59.520 --> 35:00.520
If he finds out, so be it.

35:01.440 --> 35:02.680
It's only a matter of time.

35:06.080 --> 35:07.200
Pretending for too long

35:07.920 --> 35:09.040
gets exhausting anyway.

35:16.840 --> 35:19.000
Revealing everything

35:20.200 --> 35:22.080
might be refreshing.

35:27.680 --> 35:29.880
You told me to wait for you to reunite.

35:30.680 --> 35:31.800
But that day,

35:32.320 --> 35:33.640
I never saw you come back.

35:34.680 --> 35:35.840
This time,

35:36.480 --> 35:37.960
it's your turn to wait for me.

35:53.040 --> 35:54.720
That's really not like you.

35:56.960 --> 35:59.440
Ningxi, I'll come

36:00.160 --> 36:01.600
to find you very soon.

36:03.400 --> 36:04.520
This time,

36:05.800 --> 36:07.280
we'll never be apart.

36:09.400 --> 36:11.240
Do you truly no longer want revenge?

36:18.000 --> 36:20.120
I never thought the mighty ruler
of the Dark Abyss

36:20.840 --> 36:22.720
would now waste away,

36:23.320 --> 36:25.880
guarding a corpse like a lost soul.

36:30.200 --> 36:32.240
No matter how much you talk to her now,

36:32.760 --> 36:33.920
she can't hear you.

36:39.440 --> 36:42.000
Ningxi, an uninvited guest has arrived.

36:43.160 --> 36:44.160
But don't worry.

36:44.880 --> 36:46.520
I'll get rid of him soon.

36:52.720 --> 36:54.480
You're disturbing Ningxi.

36:55.000 --> 36:56.400
Leave now,

36:57.000 --> 36:59.520
or I'll personally send you on your way.

37:00.880 --> 37:02.960
Su Ningxi is dead.

37:03.480 --> 37:04.960
Completely and utterly dead.

37:06.320 --> 37:08.960
No matter how much
you deceive yourself now,

37:09.040 --> 37:10.320
she's not coming back to life.

37:15.800 --> 37:18.400
You are quite rude.

37:19.040 --> 37:21.160
Your anger at what I said

37:21.680 --> 37:23.600
proves you know I'm right.

37:24.320 --> 37:25.840
So, the one you should hate isn't me,

37:26.520 --> 37:28.000
but the people who killed her.

37:34.520 --> 37:37.080
Those people are already dead.

37:37.160 --> 37:38.080
Not all of them.

37:39.280 --> 37:41.080
You were bullied by the humans
from a young age.

37:41.600 --> 37:43.240
You should've hated them long ago,

37:43.760 --> 37:47.120
yet back then, for her,
you gave up your revenge against them.

37:47.640 --> 37:50.080
And in the end, the humans killed her.

37:52.080 --> 37:54.440
It was your decision to give up revenge

37:54.520 --> 37:56.600
that led to today's tragedy.

37:57.640 --> 37:59.200
Can you really accept that?

38:08.320 --> 38:09.400
Ningxi wouldn't want me

38:10.040 --> 38:12.000
to be consumed by hatred.

38:12.080 --> 38:14.800
And what's the result
of letting go of that hatred?

38:14.880 --> 38:16.520
You lost the one you loved most,

38:16.600 --> 38:18.680
and now you're neither human nor ghost,

38:18.760 --> 38:20.720
just lost in misery here.

38:21.720 --> 38:22.800
Meanwhile,
the Immortal Alliance and humanity

38:22.880 --> 38:25.400
don't reflect on their mistakes.

38:25.480 --> 38:27.160
Instead, they mock your failure

38:27.240 --> 38:28.920
from their victors' throne.

38:31.800 --> 38:33.640
What a tragic irony.

38:34.520 --> 38:35.440
I think

38:35.960 --> 38:37.200
if Su Ningxi could see this,

38:37.280 --> 38:40.040
she'd feel it wasn't worth it
for you either.

38:44.280 --> 38:45.920
Look at yourself now.

38:47.160 --> 38:49.880
Do you think she'd still love you?

38:58.280 --> 39:01.920
Did you come here
just to spout this nonsense?

39:04.280 --> 39:06.880
I came here
because I feel it's unfair for you.

39:08.960 --> 39:12.080
Those you forgave
never chose to forgive you.

39:12.600 --> 39:14.720
You lost the one you cherished,

39:15.520 --> 39:16.640
so why should they

39:18.080 --> 39:19.680
get to keep on living?

39:25.440 --> 39:26.480
What do you want?

39:27.640 --> 39:29.040
I'll break the Immortals Array for you,

39:29.880 --> 39:32.520
and the humans will face
the punishment they deserve.

39:33.280 --> 39:34.640
But in exchange,

39:35.520 --> 39:38.320
I want you to tell me
the whereabouts of the Chaos Pearl.

39:38.960 --> 39:39.920
We can't wait any longer.

39:40.520 --> 39:41.920
If the Immortals Array is broken,

39:42.520 --> 39:44.080
the human world
will suffer great disasters.

39:44.880 --> 39:47.760
I must inform the Immortal Alliance sects
so they can prepare in advance.

39:49.440 --> 39:50.400
Mr. Nan.

39:51.880 --> 39:53.600
I have urgent matters
to attend to with Yan Tong.

39:53.680 --> 39:55.920
Please watch over Mu Xuanling.

39:57.080 --> 39:58.320
Make sure she won't act rashly.

40:02.280 --> 40:03.200
I leave it to you.

40:15.160 --> 40:16.120
I think you know me well.

40:17.000 --> 40:18.440
I will definitely act rashly.

40:19.480 --> 40:20.800
Xie Xuechen is at the Two Realms Mountain.

40:21.680 --> 40:23.120
I can't leave him there alone.

40:29.000 --> 40:30.160
You must go?

40:31.160 --> 40:32.000
I have to go.

40:32.720 --> 40:33.760
Just because he's there?

40:36.560 --> 40:37.480
Just because he's there.

40:39.840 --> 40:40.680
All right.

40:52.800 --> 40:54.360
Follow my gestures.

40:54.960 --> 40:56.200
I'll teleport you there.

41:13.520 --> 41:14.560
Nan Xuyue…

41:19.080 --> 41:20.160
Thank you.
